kly finishes typing with her right thumb, then sets the phone down on the table to her right.\nAt 00:06.000, the electronic beeps of a digital door lock being opened sound from the entrance. With her right hand she quietly closes the laptop lid, keeping the sound small, and her eyes stay on the entrance, until the end.\n\noverall_soundscape: Quiet apartment room tone in the evening, a faint distant elevator chime, the soft taps of a phone screen, then the electronic beep sequence of a digital door lock from the entrance, the soft close of a laptop lid. No voices are heard.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"
